# Get Out, first mode: "Counter target creature or enchantment spell." Bot2 casts Sol Ring (an artifact, neither a creature nor an enchantment): Get Out cannot be cast at all, with nothing else to target (the refusal),
# so it resolves. Then Bot2 casts Llanowar Elves (a creature spell), and Bot1, paying UU with a Black Lotus, counters it (the positive control); the Elves go to Bot2's graveyard.

